{"3320200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Curse of The Mask: Kaal Yoddha - An Action Adventure Game", "steam_appid": 3320200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaal Yoddha</strong> is a dark mythological action-adventure game where you play as Prince Avyaan, a skilled archer and warrior battling demons on a cursed island. Master bow, sword, and soulslike combat, uncover ancient masks, and face brutal boss battles in a story-driven dark fantasy world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/f0d29fdcf6c20688141dd3325853f9ae.poster.avif?t=1786102072\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/f0d29fdcf6c20688141dd3325853f9ae.webm?t=1786102072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cursed Island Awaits</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Kaal Yoddha, a single-player dark fantasy action-adventure game rooted in ancient myth and forgotten legends.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Prince Avyaan, a fearless warrior sent to a cursed island where demonic forces spread corruption with cursed ancient masks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/c49ce90effd4466bf1f7a1cc55e66132.poster.avif?t=1786102072\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/c49ce90effd4466bf1f7a1cc55e66132.webm?t=1786102072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Combat – Bow, Sword, Double Axe</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in dynamic soulslike-inspired combat that rewards timing, positioning, and mastery. Wield bow and arrow for ranged combat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to sword combat for intense close encounters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your playstyle to survive relentless demonic enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn enemy patterns and strike with precision.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every battle is a test of skill, not chance.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/fbd4e5228ea7814e541ac2c95091dcaa.webp?t=1786102072\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/fbd4e5228ea7814e541ac2c95091dcaa.poster.avif?t=1786102072\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parkour and Exploration </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the island using parkour and environmental navigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale cliffs and ancient structures. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate treacherous terrain.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles to unlock new paths.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/9d9d6330c57dc508c8972050644981b4.poster.avif?t=1786102072\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/9d9d6330c57dc508c8972050644981b4.webm?t=1786102072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Curse of the Mask</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is haunted by cursed masks born from an ancient Demon. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie forests, ruined temples, hidden caverns, and collapsing sanctuaries, a place where reality breaks, uncovering environmental storytelling through murals, relics, and cryptic notes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face towering monsters, cursed warriors, and demonic entities, each born from the island’s corruption. Victory is earned, not given. Will you break the curse and restore honour to your legacy, or be consumed by the darkness that rules the island?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take up your bow. Draw your blade.Become the Warrior.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaal Yoddha</strong> is a dark mythological action-adventure game where you play as Prince Avyaan, a skilled archer and warrior battling demons on a cursed island. Master bow, sword, and soulslike combat, uncover ancient masks, and face brutal boss battles in a story-driven dark fantasy world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/f0d29fdcf6c20688141dd3325853f9ae.poster.avif?t=1786102072\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/f0d29fdcf6c20688141dd3325853f9ae.webm?t=1786102072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 cl